@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Political\nAgent" as Agent
participant ":System" as System

activate Agent

    Agent -> System : asks to submit a new declaration of interests
    activate System

        System --> Agent : shows declaration type list (initial, regular, exceptional)\nand asks to select one
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : selects declaration type
    activate System

        System --> Agent : shows registered institutions and functions;\nrequests position entries (institution, function,\nnature, remuneration, start date, end date)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides one or more position entries
    activate System

        System --> Agent : requests subsidy entries\n(source institution, description, amount, date)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides subsidy entries (or skips if none)
    activate System

        System --> Agent : requests asset entries\n(type: urban/rural, acquisition value, market value)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides asset entries (or skips if none)
    activate System

        System --> Agent : requests business participation entries\n(institution, number of shares, market value)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides business participation entries (or skips if none)
    activate System

        System --> Agent : shows full declaration summary and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : confirms submission
    activate System

        System --> Agent : displays operation success;\ndeclaration set to "pending" state
    deactivate System

deactivate Agent

@enduml
